# Code Snippet Manager API

A custom-built PHP REST API with no framework, serving as the backend for a personal React application where developers can store, organise, and share code snippets. Snippets can be kept private, made public, or shared anonymously, letting users contribute to the public feed without attaching their identity to a piece of code.

This project also serves as a portfolio piece to demonstrate the ability to architect and build a REST API from first principles, without relying on a framework to handle the underlying mechanics.

---

